      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would not really work and also wouldn't make a lot of sense tbh. If your PC is to weak then either use the Quest version or turn down your settings for the PC version (higher safety settings etc.)\nIf this would work at all (which I don't really think it would, at least not without major issues) it just wouldn't make sense for them to send so much time on this, since it wouldn't really benefit most players.",
